            "findingId": "AUTHZ-03",
            "parameter": "token",
            "status": "exploited",
            "authState": "Anonymous (a holder of one share token for the album) or any authenticated user/co-owner. The shares fields carry no @isAuthorized/@isAdmin directive and never check the current user or token owner.",
            "prerequisites": "Access to one album/media as owner, co-owner, or holder of one of its share tokens; or the AUTHZ-02 favoriteMedia IDOR as any authenticated user. The schema docstring promises shares are 'owned by the logged in user' — no ownership is enforced."
